@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Riders-online lobby
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
actor "Rider" as actor
box "Frontend — Ride app (ride application)" #E0F2FE
  participant "RaceLobbyPage" as page
  participant "LobbyStore" as store
  participant "LiveSessionStore" as session
end box
box "Frontend — Ride app (api library)" #E0F2FE
  participant "RideHubClient" as hub
end box
box "Backend — Telo.Ride.Api" #D1FADF
  participant "RideHub" as ridehub
end box
box "Backend — Telo.Ride.Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
  participant "RaceSession" as rs
end box
actor -> page : Open /race/:mapId/lobby?mode=online
page -> store : init(online)
store -> session : join({ kind: race, mapId })
session -> hub : start(); ServerTime x5, measure the offset
session -> hub : findRace(mapId)
hub -> ridehub : FindRace(mapId)
ridehub -> rs : Seat in the open session with the most riders, or a new one (L2-121 AC1)
ridehub -> hub : SeatsChanged to the others in the session (L2-055 AC3)
ridehub --> hub : sessionId, startsAt, seat, seats
hub --> session : race seat and grid
session --> store : race, seats
store --> page : You first, the others by seat; "Waiting for riders", "{n} of 10 seats taken..." (L2-051 AC3, L2-052)
loop on each whole second before startsAt (server time, by the offset)
  store --> page : timer "Starts in {n} seconds" (L2-051 AC5)
end
actor -> page : Press "I'm ready"
page -> store : toggleReady()
store -> session : setReady(true)
session -> hub : SetReady(sessionId, true)
hub -> ridehub : SetReady
ridehub -> rs : Mark seat ready
ridehub -> hub : SeatsChanged to every rider (L2-053 AC1)
opt a rider leaves before 0:10
  ridehub -> hub : SeatsChanged(seats, left = "MarcoVelo")
  hub --> session : seats, left
  store --> page : Notice "MarcoVelo left. Their seat is open again." (L2-055 AC1)
end
rs -> rs : At 0:10 bots fill every open seat, ready (L2-054 AC1, AC2)
ridehub -> hub : SeatsChanged (10 / 10)
store --> page : "On the start line"; first segment level sent (L2-051 AC4)
store --> page : From 0:03, countdownStep 3, 2, 1 over the inert lobby, ready or not (L2-053 AC4, L2-056)
store --> page : At startsAt, Go
store -> actor : Open /race/:mapId/ride?mode=online&session=<id>
note right of store : The race joins its session again (JoinRace) and starts its clock\nat startsAt minus the offset (L2-121 AC3, run-a-race-session)
@enduml
